# This is template feel free to change stuff your liking.
# Comments are provided to let understand what each command does.
# Usually with .gitignore-s we say what files we wish to ignore but each IDE produce different outputs that we don't want.
# So instead of saying explicitly what we don't want. We say explicitly what we do want so there is never something we never wanted to add. 

# Ignore everything.
*

# Keep those files.
!/.gitignore
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/README.md

# Keep those directories.
!/include/
!/src/

# Keep the content of those directories.
!/include/**
!/src/**

# Keep empty directories.
!/include/.gitkeep
!/src/.gitkeep